cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this archive, please cite it together with the original source (for register data: Avoimuusrekisteri, Valtiontalouden tarkastusvirasto)."
title: "Lobbaan.fi archive of the Finnish Transparency Register"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Markus Media"
    website: "https://markusmedia.fi"
repository: "https://github.com/Markus-web/lobbaan-archive"
url: "https://lobbaan.fi"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Daily, versioned copy of the Finnish Transparency Register (Avoimuusrekisteri) open data and
  related public sources since 2024, kept by Lobbaan.fi. Every record ever published stays with its
  full version history; each day's fetch is logged with the SHA-256 of the bytes received.
keywords:
  - lobbying
  - transparency register
  - avoimuusrekisteri
  - Finland
  - open data
